{"context": {"actorId": "11", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "dates/mabelDustin/dialogue", "conversationId": 133, "entryId": 304, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[133, 306]], "script": ""}, "family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:133:304:Dialogue Text", "preserveExactly": false, "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/60/dialogueEntries/51/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/60/dialogueEntries/51/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=6]Hmm, well just the other day, she pegged me with a toy half the size of her!", "sourceSha256": "75d989f16a1819e3c60969219f96d0049d845befb19b0661fd09cfb6feecbbdb", "target": "[pic=6]Hmm, noong isang araw lang, tinarakan niya ako gamit ang strap-on na may laruang kalahati ng laki niya!", "targetSha256": "b521191ba2f72cb87279d456822b48580605c33de747aaed848f9124af0f8622"}
{"context": {"actorId": "5", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "dates/mabelMaverick/dialogue", "conversationId": 136, "entryId": 201, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [], "script": ""}, "family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:136:201:Dialogue Text", "preserveExactly": false, "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/61/dialogueEntries/73/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/61/dialogueEntries/73/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=4]Take care Rascal! Maybe you can be a guinea pig for us once we get the ball rolling!", "sourceSha256": "42649437b1d4554bc785bd27414325bf83711a5fe2d01fa555d6891b1cb66826", "target": "[pic=4]Ingat, Rascal! Baka puwede kang magpaeksperimento sa amin kapag nakapagsimula na kami!", "targetSha256": "c805c7abf5383c99a844e7b36023e9cf0bc7c675cb7145f77aeb2ee5372cfb80"}
